  "license": "MIT",
  "changes": [
    "Separate document plugin, channel, helper executable and GType names to coexist with the ebook host",
    "Bounded document-only protocol with exact session identity and 1 MiB encoded-message limit",
    "Session-scoped loopback asset allowlist with Host, origin, method, path, MIME and CSP checks",
    "Single-flight asset-server startup and disposal-race cleanup; explicit absent-runtime errors",
    "Same-origin blob-only child navigation; file/content access and permission requests denied",
    "Ordinary text and editing keys dispatched through GTK; ebook-only arrow interception removed",
    "Ephemeral native WebView state, command deadlines and closed-sender protection",
    "Preserved process sandbox, native runtime version floor, isolated probe and texture allocation bounds"
  ],
